  "sourceBaseline": "3554ad7a762cd28a89f001838251b69ebdc2a999",
  "scope": "Static SVG image styling: absent hover/active/focus states, inert float, and shared source-aware XML style parsing. Ordinary cascade, rendering arithmetic, public signatures and ownership remain unchanged. Root background/border paint and physical geometry units remain separate open work.",
  "specifications": [
    "https://www.w3.org/TR/SVG2/conform.html#processing-modes",
    "https://www.w3.org/TR/selectors-4/#useraction-pseudos"
  ],
  "implementation": [
    "../../../src/Lokad.Svg/Parsing/SvgCssSelectorSyntax.cs",
    "../../../src/Lokad.Svg/Parsing/SvgStyleSheet.cs",
    "../../../src/Lokad.Svg/Parsing/SvgInlineStyleParser.cs",
    "../../../src/Lokad.Svg/Parsing/SvgRootStyleSheetParser.cs"
  ],
  "sharedModel": [
    "Compound syntax identifies hover, active, focus, focus-visible and focus-within with ordinary class specificity; matching remains false in static image conversion. Other or malformed pseudo syntax remains explicit unsupported input.",
    "Selectors are admitted before declaration semantics. Inactive-only blocks keep bounded declaration syntax/size and rule counts, but parse no paint, font or URL semantics. A list containing an active selector retains ordinary declaration admission.",
    "Inactive rule records retain neither selector nor declaration strings and do not enable the ancestor tracker. Parsed rule count still includes them; no quota is bypassed.",
    "Float has no surrounding SVG image box flow and is inert through the common inline parser. Root backgrounds and borders are visibly different and are not ignored.",
    "Three XML style-reader entry points preserve existing presentation, geometry and local-use admission while attaching the style attribute on parser failure. All direct XML style consumers use them; string/span mechanisms remain direct.",
    "Stylesheet collection captures the declaring opening element before consuming content. Attribute failures retain their attribute location; declaration/selector failures retain the style element. Existing source diagnostics are never overwritten."
  ],
  "mechanisms": {
    "test": "../../Lokad.Svg.Tests/SvgStaticCssTests.cs",
    "cases": 23,
    "roles": [
      "Six interaction-name/case and specificity cases",
      "Five other or malformed pseudo boundaries",
      "Inactive descendant/child rules cannot select font/resource/paint behavior",
      "Mixed selector lists still validate active declarations",
      "Inert float preserves geometry",
      "Inactive bookkeeping retains no selector/value/ancestor state",
      "Rule-count and declaration-size boundaries retain cleanup",
      "Root, geometry and stylesheet error locations identify their declaring source"
    ],
    "existingContracts": "Former public/late hover inputs remain exact static output assertions. The late stylesheet cleanup test retains an unsupported functional selector. Snapshot qualification separately preserves rejection-before-acquisition and valid inactive-rule acquisition."
  },
